bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Hello everyone, 

Following Thuesday incident and retex, here's a quick reminder on how the [i]prototype[/i] plugin is working.

There is currently three mods:

[img width=64 height=64]res://assets/images/gun_selector/horizontal_selector_partial.png[/img] --> Resize only horizontally.

[img width=64 height=64]res://assets/images/gun_selector/vertical_selector_partial.png[/img] --> Resize only vertically.

 [img width=64 height=64]res://assets/images/gun_selector/full_selector_partial.png[/img] --> Resize [b]BOTH[/b] vertically and horizontally.


You have to press the tab key to go from one mod to another.

Now we all have the same level of information so I expect you to act with precautions from now on.

Thank you for your time.

Eric Eccert
Executive Operational Team Manager

Ps: Any new incident will result in a two days course about rules and safety.
Ps2: This formation will be on site only.
Ps3: Amy should return from the hospital on Monday. Maybe we could her a cake or something ?

"

[node name="RichTextLabelbak" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Camera/Email" index="8" unique_id=10449299]
visible = false
offset_left = -530.0
offset_top = -62.0
offset_right = 425.0
offset_bottom = 241.0
mouse_filter = 2
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 14
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Hello Dave !

Just a quick reminder to please make sure that all equipment is put back in its place after use.

Especially the [i]prototype[/i] plugin. Seriously Dave, this thing should ABSOLUTELY not be laying around unattended like last week. 

I will have to report further infractions. 

Thank you for your attention to this matter.
Have a good week end.

Eric Eccert
Executive Operational Manager
to another."
scroll_active = false

